╔═[GROUP NOTES]══════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║                                                            ║
║   built in public. every win, every bug, every             ║
║   weekend lost to a missing semicolon — logged.            ║
║                                                            ║
║   the constraint is the point: plain HTML, CSS             ║
║   inlined, favicon inlined, strict CSP, no                 ║
║   trackers, no frameworks shipped to your                  ║
║   browser. one HTTP request per page.                      ║
║                                                            ║
║   do a lot with a little. the demoscene fit                ║
║   whole worlds into 64 KB. a page that fits in             ║
║   a single TCP round trip is this site's modest            ║
║   tribute to that tradition.                               ║
║                                                            ║
║   one entry a week, minimum. no polish, no                 ║
║   marketing. just what happened.                           ║
